# MIDItools Archive — file handling
#
# This is a preservation archive. The assembly source, firmware images and
# EEPROM data date from the 1990s and carry DOS CRLF line endings. They are
# stored byte-for-byte as they were written, so that checksums taken from this
# repository match the files that originally shipped. Git must not rewrite them.

*.asm   -text
*.ASM   -text
*.s19   -text
*.S19   -text
*.txt   -text

# Raw binary. EEPROM images in particular contain 0x0D bytes but no NULs, so
# automatic text detection misreads them and line-ending conversion corrupts
# them silently.
*.dat   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.gif   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.png   binary
*.bmp   binary
*.ico   binary

# Repository documentation, written in this century.
*.md    text eol=lf
